<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 10.9 pct yr/yr in March.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 10.9 pct yr/yr in March.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 10.9 percent year on year in March against a revised 9.5 percent in February, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.85 trillion baht in March from a revised 3.75 trillion in February.</p>
<p>    M-2			 March 97    Feb 97	 March 96</p>
<p>    Money supply		3.85	 3.75	    3.47</p>
<p>    Percentage change	10.9	  9.5	    21.9</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said March figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
